Apple's refreshed <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/studio-display/">Studio Display</a> arrives alongside the all-new &zwnj;Studio Display&zwnj; XDR, which replaces the previous Pro Display XDR. The &zwnj;Studio Display&zwnj; XDR is more than twice the price of the &zwnj;Studio Display&zwnj;, so which should you choose?<br/>
